{"4571000": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Secho", "steam_appid": 4571000, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "dlc": [4738840], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Secho</strong></i> is a dark roguelite in which you play as a sentient alchemical mistake. You are blind. To see your prey, you must make sound. To kill your prey, you must sacrifice part of your own health as the cost of a strike.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SEE THROUGH NOISE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are blind while motionless. You want to scream, but you have no mouth. Use echolocation to reveal the world from the darkness. At some point, rain will begin, and the rules of sound will change — learn to adapt to the rhythmic downpour in order to see.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4571000/extras/837058af62ab29e92a22882202f9a3ab.poster.avif?t=1784893195\" width=624 height=194 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4571000/extras/837058af62ab29e92a22882202f9a3ab.webm?t=1784893195\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4571000/extras/837058af62ab29e92a22882202f9a3ab.mp4?t=1784893195\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>LOOK INTO SOLE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no friends or foes here; you can’t trust anyone. Look for subtle clues to determine the true objective. Don’t attack everyone indiscriminately—it’s dangerous. Examine your heart to distinguish the true objective from a trap. Seek the truth amid the deceptions before they begin the ritual.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4571000/extras/e616a5cee31cb795b6dc4abfbe35efbe.poster.avif?t=1784893195\" width=624 height=194 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4571000/extras/e616a5cee31cb795b6dc4abfbe35efbe.webm?t=1784893195\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4571000/extras/e616a5cee31cb795b6dc4abfbe35efbe.mp4?t=1784893195\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CHOOSE YOUR PATH</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The map features a variety of levels with unique challenges. Choose your path and make your way through.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4571000/extras/8a84693228572e16bf0c25e938a0d576.poster.avif?t=1784893195\" width=624 height=194 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4571000/extras/8a84693228572e16bf0c25e938a0d576.webm?t=1784893195\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4571000/extras/8a84693228572e16bf0c25e938a0d576.mp4?t=1784893195\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>UPGRADE TO YOUR OWM TASTE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create your own path through conscious choices. Grow stronger with every new goal</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4571000/extras/923b0c02f7b6cf804d9b532c2c05b77f.poster.avif?t=1784893195\" width=624 height=194 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4571000/extras/923b0c02f7b6cf804d9b532c2c05b77f.webm?t=1784893195\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4571000/extras/923b0c02f7b6cf804d9b532c2c05b77f.mp4?t=1784893195\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Secho</strong></i> is a dark roguelite in which you play as a sentient alchemical mistake. You are blind. To see your prey, you must make sound. To kill your prey, you must sacrifice part of your own health as the cost of a strike.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SEE THROUGH NOISE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are blind while motionless. You want to scream, but you have no mouth. Use echolocation to reveal the world from the darkness. At some point, rain will begin, and the rules of sound will change — learn to adapt to the rhythmic downpour in order to see.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4571000/extras/837058af62ab29e92a22882202f9a3ab.poster.avif?t=1784893195\" width=624 height=194 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4571000/extras/837058af62ab29e92a22882202f9a3ab.webm?t=1784893195\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4571000/extras/837058af62ab29e92a22882202f9a3ab.mp4?t=1784893195\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>LOOK INTO SOLE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no friends or foes here; you can’t trust anyone. Look for subtle clues to determine the true objective. Don’t attack everyone indiscriminately—it’s dangerous. Examine your heart to distinguish the true objective from a trap. Seek the truth amid the deceptions before they begin the ritual.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4571000/extras/e616a5cee31cb795b6dc4abfbe35efbe.poster.avif?t=1784893195\" width=624 h